exports[`preserves the existing player markup (readOnly=false) 1`] = `"<section class="panel practice-player" aria-label="프로젝트 연습 플레이어"><div class="score-wrap" aria-label="정본 ArrangementRenderDocument 악보"></div><div class="transport"><button class="primary" type="button" disabled="">Play</button><button type="button" disabled="">Pause</button><button type="button" disabled="">Resume</button><button type="button" disabled="">Reset</button></div><div class="voices"><div class="voice"><strong>Lead</strong> <button type="button" aria-label="Lead mute" aria-pressed="false">Mute</button> <button type="button" aria-label="Lead solo" aria-pressed="false">Solo</button><label class="volume">Lead 음량 <input type="range" min="0" max="200" step="5" aria-label="Lead volume" value="100"/><output>100%</output></label></div><div class="voice"><strong>Lower / H1</strong> <button type="button" aria-label="Lower / H1 mute" aria-pressed="false">Mute</button> <button type="button" aria-label="Lower / H1 solo" aria-pressed="false">Solo</button><label class="volume">Lower / H1 음량 <input type="range" min="0" max="200" step="5" aria-label="Lower / H1 volume" value="100"/><output>100%</output></label></div><div class="voice"><strong>Band</strong> <button type="button" aria-pressed="true">Band On</button><label class="volume">Band 음량 <input type="range" min="0" max="200" step="5" aria-label="Band volume" value="100"/><output>100%</output></label></div></div><label class="volume">전체 음량 <input type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5" aria-label="Master volume" value="100"/><output>100%</output></label><label class="speed">Speed <select aria-label="Playback speed"><option value="50">50%</option><option value="75">75%</option><option value="100" selected="">100%</option><option value="125">125%</option><option value="150">150%</option></select></label><p>음량·Mute·Solo·Band는 재생 중에도 적용됩니다. 음량 100%는 파트별 기본 믹스이며, 속도를 바꾸면 처음으로 돌아갑니다.</p><p class="status" aria-live="polite">준비 · 0.00 / 16.00 quarter · event <code>—</code></p></section>"`;

